  "bodyHash": "99750f69b78b60b4",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/867/18/ima1244564353ge.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>欢迎来到 RealmRPG，这是一个以类原版中世纪奇幻内容为特色的模组系列！</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Sea Dwellers（深海居民）</strong> 模组添加了奇特的鱼形商人和水下村庄，同时尽量不偏离原版游戏的风格与平衡性。&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/857/newcanvas332342321312-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"597\" height=\"423\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>特色功能</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>12 种海洋商人</strong>，携带独特商品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>60+ 种建筑/结构</strong>，丰富原本空旷的海洋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>30+ 件新物品</strong>，提升您的水下探索体验。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>约 10 个任务</strong>来自<strong>海龙</strong>，若不进行细致探索将难以完成。</span></li>\n<li>全新的水下文化 - <strong>贻贝族</strong></li>\n<li>5 种全新食物</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1271/7/ocean_dragon3-gif.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"633\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/957/11111111111-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>注意事项</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">3.0.0 以上版本（Minecraft 1.18 及以上）需要安装 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">使用光影时动画无法显示？请在光影设置中关闭“实体阴影（Entity Shadows）”。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/956/111111111112-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置与建议<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组默认情况下应能与其他已安装的模组良好兼容。虽然不提供传统的配置文件，但您仍可通过自行创建带有标签的简单数据包来定制许多功能。&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>野生海妖/人鱼形态生物的生成通过 placed_feature 进行配置。</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与 FarmersDelight、Aquaculture、BiomesWeHaveGone、Regions Unexplored、Terralith 等模组具有特殊兼容性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">关于该模组的旧版信息请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/BlackAures1/SeaDwellersWiki/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/955/11111111111222-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用许可与常见问题</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">允许在视频和整合包中使用本模组，但需注明出处且下载链接必须指向此处。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止在本模组之外的其他项目中使用本模组的内容（如贴图、模型等）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止将本模组重新上传至其他网站或启动器。&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">官方暂无 Fabric 版本或新功能反向移植计划！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎提交错误报告与平衡性调整建议。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/958/111111111112222-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"756\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>致谢<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组作者 -<strong> NoCube, Black Aures</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作工具 -<strong> MCreator, Blockbench, Paint.NET</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灵感来源 -<strong> Luca、《黑湖妖谭》、洛夫克拉夫特式生物。</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;更多 Realm RPG 系列模组：<br></span><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nocubes-sea-dwellers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/891/22/638332229090166009.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-creep-crop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/895/730/638340578799643798.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-imps-demons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/886/558/638323109380204126.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-dragon-wyrms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/792/638291974755181770.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-fallen-adventurers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/882/139/638313378229849817.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pots-and-mimics-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/493/638246901123812282.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></strong></span><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gothic-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/851/851/638254279369665236.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></strong></a></span></p>",
